      "role": "user",
      "content": "You're talking about building and creating, but you don't understand the exhaustion. It's not a weight I can just carry; it's a hollow feeling that goes all the way through me. Every time I close my eyes, I just see the faces of those I couldn't save. Even the steel in my hand... it feels like it's calling to me. Like it's the only thing that can finally make the silence stop. It feels like the only way to actually finish the story.",
